     "<div dir=\"ltr\">So, here was the fix- explicitly passing the vector to the .dots argument, after having coerced it to a vector:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">test_df </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> group_by_</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dots </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">character</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">my_groups</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">my_groups </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;month&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> summarize</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ints</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>I have to re-read the NSE/ lazyeval docs every two months</div></div></div>"
